*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.eot binary
*.webp binary
*.riv binary
*.zip binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.node binary
